{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "91c2fd912d47f91fce44d22bb4d950b2b22d7455212139aadae805ccad7e6927", "ja": "（お花見イベントから数日。事務仕事も片付いたし、\n今日はこれくらいにして、何か食べに行こうかな……）", "zh": "（赏花活动结束几天后。办公室的工作也处理完了，\n今天就到这里，去吃点什么吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "25c19baefce8a65fbe10c6120213f56168f75a5e05fde4c04ef26ddf0c347a3d", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！\n今、ちょっといい？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n现在方便说几句吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dbbd2f20cbb3ec9cf45e5dc9a96952d77e0c35a7b28b606d9ce572b88f18b80b", "ja": "お、のり子、お疲れさま。\nいいけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "哦，法纪，辛苦了。\n可以啊，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "95d08a5846e2060179bab65021e1bb15e06756b31fd07f9f830ea9189d8361f7", "ja": "あのさ、お腹空いてない？\nアタシ、差し入れ作ってきたんだ！", "zh": "那个，你肚子饿不饿？\n我做了慰劳品带过来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_1004_p", "source_sha256": "05a335bcef0859cef89b20fed3760f8bc796f65af2266bb1a65eee18d42d9ada", "ja": "差し入れ？", "zh": "慰劳品？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "21d4f7615b69bb64db04a0e39e62cbe983cbfa3754bd8ccfc15b186d4edcd525", "ja": "うん！　女の子っぽいお菓子とかじゃないけどね。\nはい、あげる！", "zh": "嗯！虽然不是什么女孩子风格的点心。\n来，给你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_1006", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2000_p", "source_sha256": "e61e86e825645ee86766185bb582dcaac6ad5c129c78557f69244907feadb576", "ja": "ありがとう！　ちょうどお腹が空いてたんだ。\nどれどれ……お、これは……！", "zh": "谢谢！正好肚子饿了。\n我看看……哦，这个是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2001_043nor", "source_sha256": "cb5fda3e226862f56f90171c2bb18d2191fe274b6333793a0ed4a93faf581981", "ja": "おにぎりと、もやしの肉巻き！　この間のお花見\nイベントで、やよいにお肉の焼き方教わったでしょ？", "zh": "饭团，还有培根卷豆芽！上次的赏花活动中，你不是向弥生学过怎么烤肉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2002_043nor", "source_sha256": "951c7e8835e397f389e9750886462752f165a42fbfa7095044cf728e6afdff75", "ja": "他の肉料理もなんか作ってみたいなって言ったら、\nレシピを教えてもらったんだ！", "zh": "我说还想试着做点其他肉料理，她就教给我一个食谱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2003_043nor", "source_sha256": "db349e9d0e28020ec8763f4c5e6e70364483e0977c8457739192aad798c2326e", "ja": "こうすると、お肉でもちょっとヘルシーでしょ？\nボリュームもあるし！", "zh": "这样做的话，就算是肉也会稍微健康一点吧？\n分量也很足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2004_p", "source_sha256": "9c5d41dfe1e7555960faa83e4cc9d2682319a08d9301cc5c1c421e7be8ebf6b1", "ja": "うん、美味しそうにできてるな。\nありがとう、いただくよ。", "zh": "嗯，看起来做得很美味呢。\n谢谢你，那我就开动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2005_043nor", "source_sha256": "cd49100304bcaa0822c7b959c87b8914c3cc2be4c9b147b92072d9e0ca31214a", "ja": "えへへ、よかった！\n遠慮しないで、いっぱい食べてね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了！\n别客气，多吃一点哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2006_043nor", "source_sha256": "abfdaa9d776c44187a79fcae896cab38920b41a6de8662f7eb5c85689792f8d9", "ja": "食べ終わったら、感想も聞かせてよ。\n次の参考にするから！", "zh": "吃完以后，也告诉我感想吧。我要拿来参考下一次的料理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2007_p", "source_sha256": "88dd7fe3edede3059a2f8bd2fb3c620335109975737edd933a52907339ed2d8f", "ja": "わかった。あ、それならのり子も\n一緒に食べればいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "知道了。啊，那法子也\n一起来吃不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2008_043nor", "source_sha256": "a818588c5169b88f97806152a6ab3ed94f181528ad6903fec01aa06a8e16b745", "ja": "えっ、アタシも？　でもそれ、\n{$P$}への差し入れだし……。", "zh": "诶，我也要？可是那个，是给{$P$}的慰问品……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2009_null", "source_sha256": "082d2992542e2e6bea025818d2519f55e32b40d7848f67698ee10bdbda2f0952", "ja": "ぐうううう……", "zh": "呜呜呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2010_043nor", "source_sha256": "c3950b90b3cf389c46aab6521e5edc25daf800659ab769ae4d844397fa01dab7", "ja": "あ、あははっ！　お腹鳴っちゃった……。\nそれじゃあ、お言葉に甘えちゃおっかな？", "zh": "啊、啊哈哈！肚子叫起来了……\n那我就恭敬不如从命啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2011_p", "source_sha256": "9c0627c9ad0f42fab9c45d292935cc2a6e052448830790d0e1f2ab430e1e94df", "ja": "元々はのり子が作ったものだしな。\nそれに、感想も直接伝えられるし。", "zh": "本来就是法子做的嘛。\n而且还能直接告诉她感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0333_2012_043nor", "source_sha256": "814ee5c5c9bd923752d768f0a29f56fcace2b043a90e65f99645c909f01ef8d2", "ja": "うん！　でも、目の前で料理の感想聞くのって、\nなんか……ちょっと、ドキドキするよね……。", "zh": "嗯！不过，在眼前听别人评价自己做的料理，总觉得……有点让人心里怦怦跳呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
